WEBVTT

NOTE Full translated speech. Cue starts use source speech alignment.
End holds may extend within the observed pause before the next cue.

raquel-honrar-familia-001
00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:01.600 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
Hi, everyone.

raquel-honrar-familia-002
00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:07.060 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
As I said, at Nova Geração Brasil, we have
a partnership

raquel-honrar-familia-003
00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:13.040 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
with Instituto Virtudes, and we’ve been
working on virtues with the children.

raquel-honrar-familia-004
00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:18.900 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
Every 15 days, we practice one virtue with
them.

raquel-honrar-familia-005
00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:24.400 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
What’s interesting is how curious the
children are.

raquel-honrar-familia-006
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:28.800 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
The younger they are, the less resistance
they show.

raquel-honrar-familia-007
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:34.540 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
Meanwhile, the older ones, the teenagers,
try to pretend they don’t

raquel-honrar-familia-008
00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:38.860 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
care. They’re not very keen and find it
hard to accept some

raquel-honrar-familia-009
00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:39.300 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
things.

raquel-honrar-familia-010
00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:45.920 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
But it’s good to see the process and how
it has transformed their lives.

raquel-honrar-familia-011
00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:47.760 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
It was incredible.

raquel-honrar-familia-012
00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:52.160 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
One that surprised me most, perhaps more
than any, was Honoring

raquel-honrar-familia-013
00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:52.710 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
the Family.

raquel-honrar-familia-014
00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:57.130 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
When I worked on this virtue with them,

raquel-honrar-familia-015
00:00:57.130 --> 00:01:02.150 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
I hoped to restore some things. They talk
about family,

raquel-honrar-familia-016
00:01:02.150 --> 00:01:07.930 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
even defending it negatively, through
revenge at

raquel-honrar-familia-017
00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:13.890 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
times. I thought we would go in another
direction, toward very

raquel-honrar-familia-018
00:01:13.890 --> 00:01:18.730 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
positive things. It was very positive, but
it brought a lot of pain

raquel-honrar-familia-019
00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:23.210 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
to the surface, many unresolved issues
with their parents,

raquel-honrar-familia-020
00:01:23.670 --> 00:01:29.490 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
a need for forgiveness in the family and
to see they’re part of the process.

raquel-honrar-familia-021
00:01:30.010 --> 00:01:35.350 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
It’s very interesting how each virtue
reaches depths

raquel-honrar-familia-022
00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:40.890 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
and works in our lives, and children’s
lives, in ways we never imagined.

raquel-honrar-familia-023
00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:46.010 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
I’ve always been very open to it. Of
course, we know the people we

raquel-honrar-familia-024
00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:50.050 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
work with well, so we have some idea of
the direction. But we always

raquel-honrar-familia-025
00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:53.830 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
get positive surprises. Working on the
virtue of Honoring

raquel-honrar-familia-026
00:01:53.830 --> 00:01:59.010 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
the Family, for instance, brought
excellent results. So,

raquel-honrar-familia-027
00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:03.810 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
devote time to discovering virtues,
studying Virtology and following

raquel-honrar-familia-028
00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:07.690 line:90% position:50% align:center size:90%
our work and the Institute’s work on
Instagram. Bye!
